 "version": 3,
 "title": "Material dynamic colour card",
 "summary": "A now-playing card whose every colour is a Material dynamic colour role (color.system_neutral1_900, accent1_200, ...), so it re-themes with the device palette and keeps sensible fallbacks.",
 "prompt": "Make a now-playing music card that picks up the device's Material You wallpaper colours.",
