 "check": {
  "describe": "inspect_theme lists the five roles; render_rc variables {color.system_accent1_200: #FFFFB4A9} recolours that tile; a host's own palette wins over the document's fallbacks. Resized, the card fills the box, the text column takes the rest of the row and each line ends in an ellipsis rather than wrapping when narrow.",
